#: flowing.providers.anthropic.AnthropicMessagesProvider.generate_stream:3 of
msgid ""
"Anthropic Messages ``stream=true`` 响应逐帧解析。帧为 ``data: <json>``（类型在 JSON 的 "
"``type`` 字段），事件序列： ``message_start`` → "
"``content_block_start/delta/stop``（可多条）→ ``message_delta`` → "
"``message_stop``。"
msgstr ""

#: flowing.providers.anthropic.AnthropicMessagesProvider.generate_stream:8 of
msgid "正文：``content_block_delta`` 的 ``text_delta`` → ``kind=\"text\"``。"
msgstr ""

#: flowing.providers.anthropic.AnthropicMessagesProvider.generate_stream:9 of
msgid ""
"思考：``thinking_delta`` → ``kind=\"thinking\"``；签名来自 "
"``content_block_start`` 的 ``signature``（附在首条 thinking delta 上，agent "
"累积时保留到 ``ThinkingBlock.signature``——Anthropic 多轮回放必需）。"
msgstr ""

#: flowing.providers.anthropic.AnthropicMessagesProvider.generate_stream:13 of
msgid ""
"工具：``tool_use`` 块的 ``input_json_delta`` 逐段拼 JSON， ``content_block_stop`` "
"时以完整 :class:`ToolCallBlock` 的 ``block`` delta 产出。"
msgstr ""

#: flowing.providers.anthropic.AnthropicMessagesProvider.generate_stream:16 of
msgid ""
"用量 / stop：``message_start.usage`` 的 input / cache 与 "
"``message_delta.usage`` 的 output 合并为末帧 usage； "
"``message_delta.delta.stop_reason`` 经 ``provider_data[\"stop_reason\"]`` "
"透出。"
msgstr ""

#: flowing.providers.anthropic.AnthropicMessagesProvider.generate_stream:20 of
msgid "帧内 ``error``（含 overloaded 等在流中途触发）按 :meth:`_classify_error` 归类上抛。"
msgstr ""

