#: flowing.providers.openai.OpenAICompletionsProvider:1 of
msgid "OpenAI Completions 格式的框架基类（``api_format=\"openai_completions\"``）。"
msgstr ""

#: flowing.providers.openai.OpenAICompletionsProvider:5 of
msgid ""
"所有 OpenAI 兼容端点 adapter 的基类：实现请求/响应格式映射——把 "
":class:`flowing.context.Context` 的三个字段映射为 chat/completions 请求体（system "
"消息、messages 数组、tools 声明），把响应映射为 :class:`ProviderResponse`，并把原始用量归一为 "
":class:`Usage` （``prompt_tokens`` → ``input``， ``fresh_input = "
"prompt_tokens - cached_tokens``）。子类只覆写差异： 默认端点（``default_base_url``）、 "
"凭证来源、厂商特有字段。"
msgstr ""

#: flowing.providers.openai.OpenAICompletionsProvider:30 of
msgid ""
"请求映射：``Context.system_prompt`` 逐段成为 system 消息； ``Context.messages`` 逐条按 "
"kind 映射 role；``Context.tools`` 经 白名单组装为 function "
"声明；``model.max_output_tokens`` 非 ``None`` 时写入 ``max_tokens``。"
msgstr ""

#: flowing.providers.openai.OpenAICompletionsProvider:34 of
msgid ""
"通用透传：models.yaml 条目中的 ``extra_body`` 字段（进 ``ModelConfig._extra``，不参与 "
"Parsable 求值）为 dict 时原样 合入请求体，承载厂商私有参数；非 dict 抛 "
":class:`flowing.errors.InvalidRequestError`。合入顺序：基类 固定字段 → ``extra_body``"
" → adapter 专有字段，同名键后者覆盖 前者。"
msgstr ""

#: flowing.providers.openai.OpenAICompletionsProvider:40 of
msgid ""
"响应映射：响应含 ``tool_calls`` → ``finish=False``，其余 → ``finish=True``；原始 "
"``finish_reason`` 保留在 ``provider_data[\"stop_reason\"]``。"
msgstr ""

#: flowing.providers.openai.OpenAICompletionsProvider:43 of
msgid ""
"Usage 归一：``input = prompt_tokens``、 ``fresh_input = prompt_tokens - "
"cached_tokens``、 ``cache_read = cached_tokens``、``cache_write = 0``、 "
"``output = completion_tokens``、``total_tokens = input + output``； "
"原始用量字段全量保留在 ``Usage.raw``。"
msgstr ""

#: flowing.providers.openai.OpenAICompletionsProvider:48 of
msgid "不做厂商探测（如按 ``base_url`` 猜测能力）——厂商差异属于子类覆写。"
msgstr ""

#: flowing.providers.openai.OpenAICompletionsProvider:49 of
